#: b42383e0bceb46f3a40c0cbdcccd11f0
msgid "通过组合节点特征和边属性来构建边特征的模块。"
msgstr ""
"A module that builds edge features by combining node features and edge "
"attributes."

#: f410ca43a7a3489aacb3c52d7c767dbd
msgid ""
"该模块的核心思想是使用一个可学习的张量积（Tensor Product）来融合来自 "
"源节点、目标节点以及它们之间连线的几何信息（球谐函数表示的边属性）。 张量积的权重不是固定的，而是通过一个全连接网络（FCN）根据边的径向 "
"距离嵌入动态生成的，这使得模型能够根据距离调整相互作用的强度和形式。"
msgstr ""
"The core idea of this module is to use a learnable Tensor Product to fuse "
"geometric information (edge attributes represented by spherical harmonics) "
"from the source node, target node, and the connection between them. The "
"weights of the tensor product are not fixed but are dynamically generated "
"by a fully connected network (FCN) based on the radial distance embedding "
"of the edges. This allows the model to adjust the strength and form of "
"interactions based on distance."

#: 4ae1ccc1afb441f6b43762688e5c9382 bf2212156528438a9bb0d0753af9ed2b
msgid "用于处理源节点特征的线性层。"
msgstr "Linear layer for processing source node features."

#: c22e288851fb4756bea124a1128ebccf f7f3079537c3435b874a2c521faf14f1
msgid "用于处理目标节点特征的线性层。"
