#: 2d250a9121eb41d7b46d3d383b1bf469
msgid "`Edge_builder` 的一个变体，使用两个不同节点特征的张量积。"
msgstr "A variant of `Edge_builder` that uses the tensor product of two different node features."

#: b1da80e2d2014bc3bad51acfc0566b61
msgid ""
"这个模块将源节点特征和目标节点特征分别进行线性变换后，直接进行张量积， 而不是像 `Edge_builder` "
"那样先将它们相加。这允许模型学习更复杂的、 非对称的相互作用。最终计算出的特征会累加到已有的边特征上。"
msgstr ""
"This module applies linear transformations to the source and target node features separately and then computes their tensor product directly, "
"instead of adding them first as in `Edge_builder`. This allows the model to learn more complex, asymmetric interactions. "
"The resulting features are added to the existing edge features."

#: acafeaf4d05c45d5aa486176801bda68
msgid "构建三元组（triplet, k-j-i）特征的模块。"
msgstr "A module for constructing triplet (k-j-i) features."

#: f2c5e97b403a48aba580b437ffbb8f5b
msgid ""
"此模块旨在捕捉原子间的三体相互作用信息。它通过张量积组合两条 相连边（k->j 和 j->i）的特征来创建三元组特征。张量积的权重由 "
"这三点形成的夹角嵌入（通过球谐函数计算）来动态调节。"
msgstr ""
"This module aims to capture three-body interaction information between atoms. It creates triplet features by combining the features of two "
"connected edges (k->j and j->i) through a tensor product. The weights of the tensor product are dynamically modulated by the angular "
"embedding (calculated via spherical harmonics) formed by these three points."

#: 465c11595e1f46289e3eaeaee959026b
msgid "用于角度嵌入的球谐函数层。"
msgstr "Spherical harmonics layer for angular embedding."

#: 0644a50a8cb74dd99b33ba87a305a519
msgid "sph_harm_layer"
msgstr "sph_harm_layer"

#: 8704d99895864c0cace68c9311884c08
msgid "边 k->j 特征的线性变换层。"
msgstr "Linear transformation layer for edge k->j features."

#: ba7439a3763c420fad5ef9f80bd5d8e6
msgid "边 j->i 特征的线性变换层。"
msgstr "Linear transformation layer for edge j->i features."

#: ab1506cc11e8431cb00893a8b487a986
msgid "根据角度嵌入生成张量积权重的全连接网络。"
msgstr "Fully connected network that generates tensor product weights based on angular embeddings."

#: d36a1b71c3b34a7e847bf8d3ba74264b
msgid "计算图中的所有三元组 (k->j->i)。"
msgstr "Computes all triplets (k->j->i) in the graph."

#: f8ed46abfb8648c1bab3e41572cd2359
msgid ""
"利用 `torch_sparse` 的 `SparseTensor` 高效地寻找相连的边。 一个三元组由中心原子 j，以及两个邻居 i 和 k "
"构成。"
msgstr ""
"Efficiently finds connected edges using `torch_sparse.SparseTensor`. A triplet consists of a central atom j and two neighbors, i and k."

